        "created_at": "2025-02-18T15:19:46.989Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Recorded on a day of love.    <a href=\"https://youtu.be/-7hjdC8-jbw?si=KtxSOVc_VAqcflmv\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://youtu.be/-7hjdC8-jbw?si=KtxSOVc_VAqcflmv</a></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-88\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-88\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-88\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #88</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We're back and we're live and we're gonna say a bunch of things! Show Notes: Run Time: 2:05:00 We haven't talked much this month about love and/or romance, but that ends now! We're making this happen! Or, at least, we're gonna take a swing at it!...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, March 4th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#311</span> - Writers’ Room: Prime Wardens vs the Court of Blood</li>\n<li>Tuesday, March 11th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#312</span> - Writers’ Room: Calypso vs. Ra</li>\n<li>Tuesday, March 18th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#89</span></li>\n<li>Tuesday, March 25th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#313</span> - Writers’ Room: A Bugbear Story</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Expected Recording schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, February 28th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#311</span> - Writers’ Room: Prime Wardens vs the Court of Blood</li>\n<li>Friday, March 7th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#312</span> - Writers’ Room: Calypso vs. Ra</li>\n<li>Friday, March 14th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#89</span></li>\n<li>Friday, March 21st: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#313</span> - Writers’ Room: A Bugbear Story</li>\n</ul>",
